e. The operator principle stands: OpenCode and Claude Code are coequal harnesses.'\n","file_path":"\u003crepo\u003e/.tmp/missions/opencode-design-r5.yaml"},"tool_input_hash":"f5e6a5b1eb9bebf4dcdd823e9f73a7005bf37a891dae35217370360ec54df837","tool_input_preview":"{\"content\":\"leader: claude\\nworker: bwk\\nevaluator: rsc\\ntype: design\\ninputs:\\n  ticket: ethos-5y4r\\nwrite_set:\\n  - docs/design-opencode-plugin.md\\n  - DESIGN.md\\nsuccess_criteria:\\n  - 'Answer ever..."}
